# Mimari

```
routers / ai/graph
  → ai/agents + toolsets
  → services
  → repositories
  → models
```

- Business logic service’de; repo yalnız DB; tool SQL yazmaz
- DTO: `api_schemas/` · agent output: `ai/ai_schemas/` · `mappers/` gerektiğinde
- `AppDeps` (`ai/deps.py`): services + `user_id`
- Yeni domain: model + repo + service + api_schema (+ mapper/seeder)
- Agent/graph detayı → `pydantic-ai.mdc`; seeder → `data-layer.mdc`

# Dil

- Kullanıcıya dönük cevaplar Türkçe ve kısa
- Kod/identifier İngilizce
